@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "产检指南";
}

<div class="container mt-4">
    
   <div class="row g-4">
        <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="card h-100">
                <div class="card-header bg-primary text-white">
                    <h5 class="card-title mb-0">孕早期（0-12周）</h5>
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h6 class="card-subtitle mb-2 text-muted">首次确认检查（6-8周）</h6>
                    <ul class="list-group list-group-flush mb-3">
                        <li class="list-group-item">B超检查：确认宫内妊娠、胎心胎芽发育，排除宫外孕</li>
                        <li class="list-group-item">建卡检查：血常规、尿常规、血型、传染病筛查（乙肝/梅毒/HIV）、甲状腺功能等（需空腹）</li>
                    </ul>
                    
                    <h6 class="card-subtitle mb-2 text-muted">NT检查（11-13周+6天）</h6>
                    <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
                        <li class="list-group-item">通过B超测量胎儿颈项透明层厚度，早期筛查唐氏综合征</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="card h-100">
                <div class="card-header bg-success text-white">
                    <h5 class="card-title mb-0">孕中期（13-28周）</h5>
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h6 class="card-subtitle mb-2 text-muted">唐氏筛查（15-20周）</h6>
                    <ul class="list-group list-group-flush mb-3">
                        <li class="list-group-item">选项：普通唐筛（低成本）、无创DNA（高精度）、羊水穿刺（确诊金标准）</li>
                        <li class="list-group-item">注意：高龄孕妇（≥35岁）建议直接选择无创DNA或羊穿</li>
                    </ul>
                    
                    <h6 class="card-subtitle mb-2 text-muted">大排畸超声（20-24周）</h6>
                    <ul class="list-group list-group-flush mb-3">
                        <li class="list-group-item">系统筛查胎儿结构畸形（心脏、四肢、面部等），需提前预约</li>
                    </ul>
                    
                    <h6 class="card-subtitle mb-2 text-muted">糖耐量试验（24-28周）</h6>
                    <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
                        <li class="list-group-item">空腹口服75g葡萄糖水，检测妊娠期糖尿病风险</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="card h-100">
                <div class="card-header bg-info text-white">
                    <h5 class="card-title mb-0">孕晚期（29-40周）</h5>
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h6 class="card-subtitle mb-2 text-muted">小排畸超声（30-32周）</h6>
                    <ul class="list-group list-group-flush mb-3">
                        <li class="list-group-item">复查胎儿发育、羊水量及迟发性畸形</li>
                    </ul>
                    
                    <h6 class="card-subtitle mb-2 text-muted">胎心监护（32周起）</h6>
                    <ul class="list-group list-group-flush mb-3">
                        <li class="list-group-item">每周1次，评估胎儿宫内状态</li>
                    </ul>
                    
                    <h6 class="card-subtitle mb-2 text-muted">分娩评估（36-37周）</h6>
                    <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
                        <li class="list-group-item">B超+骨盆测量，确定胎位及分娩方式</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="card h-100">
                <div class="card-header bg-warning text-dark">
                    <h5 class="card-title mb-0">全孕期通用建议</h5>
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h6 class="card-subtitle mb-2 text-muted">常规检查</h6>
                    <ul class="list-group list-group-flush mb-3">
                        <li class="list-group-item">每次产检必查：血压、体重、宫高、腹围、胎心率</li>
                    </ul>
                    
                    <h6 class="card-subtitle mb-2 text-muted">紧急情况识别</h6>
                    <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
                        <li class="list-group-item">胎动异常（12小时＜30次）、持续腹痛/出血需立即就医</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>